{"id":"f328735b5cc4e034","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-turing-degree-properties.md","title":"Turing Degree Properties","display":"thm-turing-degree-properties — Turing Degree Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-turing-degree-properties","aliases":["58-thm-turing-degree-properties"],"display":"thm-turing-degree-properties — Turing Degree Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-turing-degree-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-turing-degree-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-turing-degree-properties — Turing Degree Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"227c7eaf354f0ec0\" href=\"?note=227c7eaf354f0ec0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md\">../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f65c348d236e554\" href=\"?note=7f65c348d236e554\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md\">../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (Turing-degree structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"227c7eaf354f0ec0\" href=\"?note=227c7eaf354f0ec0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md\">../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]_T\">\\([A]_T\\)</span> (Turing 度)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{a}, \\mathbf{b}, \\mathbf{c} \\in \\mathcal{D}_T\">\\(\\mathbf{a}, \\mathbf{b}, \\mathbf{c} \\in \\mathcal{D}_T\\)</span> (Turing 度)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\in \\mathbf{a}\">\\(A, B \\in \\mathbf{a}\\)</span> (代表元)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}=[\\emptyset]_T\">\\(\\mathbf{0}=[\\emptyset]_T\\)</span> (least degree, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"227c7eaf354f0ec0\" href=\"?note=227c7eaf354f0ec0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md\">../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}&#39;=[K]_T\">\\(\\mathbf{0}&#39;=[K]_T\\)</span> (halting degree, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"227c7eaf354f0ec0\" href=\"?note=227c7eaf354f0ec0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md\">../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\)</span> (degree order characterized in the first assertion)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing-degree-properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;(A\\leq_TB)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing-degree-properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;(A\\leq_TB)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\vee_T\\mathbf b=[A\\oplus_TB]_T\\in\\mathcal D_T\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\vee_T\\mathbf b=[A\\oplus_TB]_T\\in\\mathcal D_T\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c)\\to\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c)\\to\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\neg(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf a)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\neg(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf a)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> is an upper semilattice: the join is represented by the oracle sum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus_TB\">\\(A\\oplus_TB\\)</span> and is independent of representatives.</li>\n<li>The degree order is tied explicitly to representative reducibility. Incomparable degrees exist, while arbitrary binary meets need not exist; hence the full degree structure is not a lattice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md","status":"resolved","id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f65c348d236e554","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md","status":"resolved","id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D_T$ (Turing-degree structure, see [[../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md","status":"resolved","id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{0}=[\\emptyset]_T$ (least degree, see [[../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md","status":"resolved","id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{0}'=[K]_T$ (halting degree, see [[../batch03/58-df-turing-degree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D_T","display":false},{"tex":"[A]_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{a}, \\mathbf{b}, \\mathbf{c} \\in \\mathcal{D}_T","display":false},{"tex":"A, B \\in \\mathbf{a}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}=[\\emptyset]_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}'=[K]_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing-degree-properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;(A\\leq_TB)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\vee_T\\mathbf b=[A\\oplus_TB]_T\\in\\mathcal D_T\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl((\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c)\\to\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf c\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree\\text{-}properties} \\vdash \\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\\bigl(\\neg(\\mathbf a\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf b)\\land\\neg(\\mathbf b\\leq_{\\mathcal D_T}\\mathbf a)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\oplus_TB","display":false}],"bytes":2162,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-turing-degree-properties.md|58-thm-turing-degree-properties]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["227c7eaf354f0ec0","7f65c348d236e554"]}